x1 T1 [[Rare Weapons|Rares]] ([https://supremevalues.com/mm2/ Supreme])|theme=uncommon}}'''Haunted House''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon knife]] that is currently obtainable in the [[Halloween Event 2026]] by collecting 7,800 [[Candies (2026)|Candies]] {{Currency|Candies2026}} and purchasing the 14th tier, or through [[trading]].

== Appearance ==
The knife features the classic Haunted House map made by Shedletsky on the blade, placed on a background with orange clouds and a black sky. The handle is a dark gray and black gradient, and the guard is a dark brown.

== Trivia ==

* The knife is inspired by the [[Haunted House]], an original map made by Roblox and featured in [[Murder Mystery|MM1]].
